  "limitations": [
    "Stimuli were not controlled for all variables (e.g., light, color), limiting generalizability.",
    "Context of data collection (fMRI scanner) might have impacted results, potentially attenuating negative responses to enclosed environments.",
    "Familiarity with standard ceiling heights might have influenced beauty judgments and approach-avoidance decisions.",
    "Exploratory nature of the study suggests a need for follow-up work with more precise hypotheses and power analysis."
  ],
